{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/06/0247060/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋フォーカスで先週今週と\n2週に渡ってお送りしてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ブラかりん」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれてますか？(๑⁰ -⁰)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日 6月7日放送分は\nブラかりん2で\n将棋の町天童を街ブラしてますので\nぜひぜひご覧ください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/06/0247060/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/06/0247060/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎NHK将棋講座テキスト6月号\n◎将棋世界7月号"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中です(｡･ω･｡)  ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHK将棋講座テキストでは\n将棋のことから乃木坂のことまで\nインタビューしていただいています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋世界はなんと戸辺先生が\nアンダーライブTシャツを着て\n講義をしてくださっています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/06/0247060/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/06/0247060/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメに載せてた枕新しいのに買い替えた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抱き枕だね(｡･ω･｡)  ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買い替えてないのー(´｡･o･｡`)\n堅い抱き枕じゃなきゃダメで\n探し中なの(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビリビリのをまだ使ってます！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いのどこかに売ってたら\n情報くださいー(´｡･o･｡`)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/06/0247060/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃんがラジオ番組持ったら最初に誰をゲストに呼びたい？(メンバーで)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいいい質問！(笑)\nこういう妄想の話好きだよ！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー誰だろう～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈か、ひめちゃんか、\n能條さん(◌•ω•◌ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由は～なんでだろう...\n分からないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この3人がいいなあ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/06/0247060/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前モバメに「初心に戻る」ってあったからブログの第1話のコメント見てきたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わー懐かしい(｡･ω･｡)  ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も第1話のコメント\n読み返そうかな？(๑⁰ -⁰)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よそよそしい感じの\nみんなのコメントとか\n今読んだら楽しいし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今読むからこそ考えられることとか\nいろいろありそうだなあ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"t